{"id":"n70875-1-11","stage":3,"title":"정답 · 正解","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70875-1-11-1","ko":"정말 잘 사귄 친구 한 명이 열 친척 안 부러운 것 같아.","zh":"我觉得，有一个交情深厚的朋友，就不用羡慕有十个亲戚的人了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"사귄","meaning":"交，结交，交往","explanation":"사귀다：交，结交，交往；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사귀다","audio":"/audio/cdf64a5f4a89467851be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15656","senseId":"1","lemma":"사귀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사귄","audio":"/audio/a87bcf7d6fcb552c2899.mp3"}},{"text":"친구","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"명이","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명이","audio":"/audio/2cef3c70027edf3bbe10.mp3"}},{"text":"열","meaning":"十","explanation":"열：十。","readings":[{"term":"열","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67805","senseId":"1","lemma":"열","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3"}},{"text":"친척","meaning":"亲戚","explanation":"친척：亲戚。","readings":[{"term":"친척","audio":"/audio/8bace21fb6009284a497.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72158","senseId":"1","lemma":"친척","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친척","audio":"/audio/8bace21fb6009284a497.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"부러운","meaning":"羡慕，眼馋","explanation":"부럽다：羡慕，眼馋；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"부럽다","audio":"/audio/f08bb8a4d146896824a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59509","senseId":"1","lemma":"부럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부러운","audio":"/audio/ef82022217eba97a5910.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"cdf64a5f4a894678","term":"사귀다","zh":"交，结交，交往","audio":"/audio/cdf64a5f4a89467851be.mp3","entryId":"15656","definition":"相互了解并亲近地相处。","pronunciation":["사귀다"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"9f96b8e22cc06bfa","term":"명","zh":"个，名","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3","entryId":"70812","definition":"计算人数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["명"]},{"id":"6f4112362e973dd6","term":"열","zh":"十","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3","entryId":"67805","definition":"九加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["열ː"]},{"id":"8bace21fb6009284","term":"친척","zh":"亲戚","audio":"/audio/8bace21fb6009284a497.mp3","entryId":"72158","definition":"与父母或配偶有血缘关系的人。","pronunciation":["친척"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"f08bb8a4d1468968","term":"부럽다","zh":"羡慕，眼馋","audio":"/audio/f08bb8a4d146896824a8.mp3","entryId":"59509","definition":"别人的事情或东西看起来很好时心里希望自己也能够做成那件事或得到那个东西。","pronunciation":["부럽따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e627131daba9fc9c2413.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70875-1-11-2","ko":"맞아, 그게 정답이야.","zh":"对，那就是正确的答案了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아,","meaning":"正确，对","explanation":"맞다：正确，对；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"1","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아","audio":"/audio/c92874385c2bbee2ea2e.mp3"}},{"text":"그게","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그것：那个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그것","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31953","senseId":"2","lemma":"그것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그게","audio":"/audio/76f4738285e0cdc443f8.mp3"}},{"text":"정답이야.","meaning":"正解，正确答案","explanation":"정답：正解，正确答案；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"정답","audio":"/audio/a94d3f6a027a180064ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70875","senseId":"1","lemma":"정답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정답이야","audio":"/audio/85ce15fb16fced0692cb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"正确，对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"问题的答案没有错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"49ef044188dcd25e","term":"그것","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3","entryId":"31953","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그걷"]},{"id":"a94d3f6a027a1800","term":"정답","zh":"正解，正确答案","audio":"/audio/a94d3f6a027a180064ca.mp3","entryId":"70875","definition":"对某个问题或提问的正确回答。","pronunciation":["정ː답"]}],"audio":"/audio/48e787210779797fff22.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.807,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70875","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":99,"sequenceScore":2.6337,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对，那就是正确的答案了。","亲爱的，等我们搬家后，要怎么布置房子呢？","我觉得，有一个交情深厚的朋友，就不用羡慕有十个亲戚的人了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对，那就是正确的答案了。","我觉得，有一个相处得非常好的朋友，比有十个亲戚还要让人羡慕呢。","亲爱的，等我们搬家后，要怎么布置房子呢？"],"answer":0}]}
